UID:10006970-1794146400-1794151800@www.calvarychurch.org
SUMMARY:GriefShare - Surviving the Holidays
DESCRIPTION:GriefShare is a friendly\, caring group of people who will walk alongside you through one of life’s most difficult experiences. You don’t have to go through the grieving process alone.\nSurviving the Holidays\nFor those who’ve lost a loved one\, the Thanksgiving and Christmas season can be bleak. This two-hour event offers coping tools and support for those who are grieving.\nRegister\nhttps://www.griefshare.org/events/263482
URL:https://www.calvarychurch.org/calendar/griefshare-surviving-the-holidays/
CATEGORIES:Ministry Highlight
END:VEVENT
